ps://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/regions/manaslu-region" class="text-primary">Manaslu</a> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/manaslu-circuit-trek">Manaslu Circuit Trek</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/best-short-manaslu-circuit-trek">Best Short Manaslu Circuit Trek</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/tsum-valley-trek">Tsum Valley Trek</a> </li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul class="mega-menu-column"> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/regions/langtang-region" class="text-primary">Langtang</a> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/5-days-langtang-valley-trek">5 days langtang valley trek</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/langtang-valley-trek">Langtang Valley Trek</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/langtang-gosaikunda-trek">Langtang Gosaikunda Trek</a> </li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </ul> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/activities/tour-in-nepal" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 uppercase">Tour in Nepal</a> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/kathmandu-city-tour">Kathmandu City Tour</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/taste-of-nepal-tour-package">Taste of Nepal Tour Package</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/honeymoon-tour-in-nepal">Honeymoon Tour in Nepal</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/pokhara-city-tour">Pokhara City Tour</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/nepal-winter-tour">Nepal Winter Tour</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/maratika-tour-in-nepal">Maratika Tour in Nepal</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/poon-hill-yoga-trek-in-nepal">Poon Hill Yoga Trek in Nepal</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.majestictrailsnepal.com/trips/lumbini-bud